sequenceDiagram
    title Logical sequence - Submit incident (POST /incidents)
    participant Client
    participant AuthMiddleware
    participant IncidentRouter
    participant AIService
    participant AIProvider
    participant Repository
    participant DBTriggers
    Client->>AuthMiddleware: POST /api/v1/incidents with Bearer token
    AuthMiddleware->>IncidentRouter: actor citizen, citizenOnly passed
    IncidentRouter->>IncidentRouter: Zod validate, photo keys under own prefix
    IncidentRouter->>Repository: withTx sets app.user_id and app.role
    IncidentRouter->>AIService: suggestClassification if no category
    AIService->>AIProvider: JSON prompt, redacted text, 8 s timeout
    AIProvider-->>AIService: category, priority, reason or error
    AIService->>Repository: INSERT ai_predictions, fallback if invalid
    Repository->>DBTriggers: INSERT incidents, RLS reporter equals me
    DBTriggers-->>Repository: INC number, ward, department, SLA, history, audit
    Repository->>DBTriggers: INSERT attachments, max 3 photos
    Repository->>Repository: UPDATE prediction decision accepted or overridden
    Repository->>DBTriggers: create_notification report_received
    Repository-->>IncidentRouter: detail and possible duplicates
    IncidentRouter-->>Client: 201 Created
